# Exception: ship the compiled CLI bundle so users can install via
# `npm install -g github:OpenSubmissionn/Open_DevTool` without a build step
!cli/dist/
!cli/dist/**

# Test / coverage
**/coverage/
test-ledger/
.anchor/

# Logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# Lockfiles. The root package-lock.json IS tracked — `install.sh` depends on
# `npm ci` to pin transitive deps for supply-chain safety (HIGH-03). Only
# nested workspace lockfiles (which can drift from the root) are ignored.
**/package-lock.json
!/package-lock.json
!/web/package-lock.json

